GET http://127.0.0.1:8002/order/feign/micrometer/hello?id=1

### 网关测试服务端get接口
GET http://127.0.0.1:9001/gateway/get?id=1

### 网关测试服务端info接口
GET http://127.0.0.1:9001/gateway/info

### 访问网关测试服务端get接口
GET http://127.0.0.1:9527/gateway/get?id=1

### 访问网关测试服务端info接口
GET http://127.0.0.1:9527/gateway/info?userType=diamond
Cookie: sender=wander
X-Request-Id: 123
Host: nas.wander.com

### 访问网关测试服务端filter接口
GET http://127.0.0.1:9527/gateway/filter

### 访问网关测试服务端filter接口，测试携带参数
GET http://127.0.0.1:9527/gateway/filter?customerId=123&customerName=zs

### 通过consumer端尝试通过OpenFeign访问接口
GET http://127.0.0.1:8002/gateway/info

### 系统外部服务通过feign接口访问时，应该通过网关
GET http://127.0.0.1:9901/out/gateway/info